Hi,
One thing to try that I've found with the BYM model in nimble, is if you don't have an intercept with the ICAR model, everything mixes much better. There's a note about intercepts in the nimble user manual too regarding the dcar_normal dist'n. Also, you could try constraining the prior on the intercept too rather than using the  dflat. In bugs, you have to use the dflat, but in nimble you don't.
--Alison

